          "author": "Peppa Pig",
          "description": "Marking five years of musical fun, this high-energy album brings a fresh pop twist to Peppa’s greatest hits! Packed with eight dynamic tracks—including a bold cover of Katy Perry’s “Roar”, the fan-favorite “Piggle Wiggle”, and exciting new takes on classics like “I Am Peppa Pig”—each song is designed to get kids (and grown-ups!) dancing, singing, and celebrating together. With feel-good vibes and catchy beats, it's the ultimate soundtrack for any Peppa party!",
